<title>UK: Novorossiisk oil port closed by thunderstorm.</title>
<headline>Novorossiisk oil port closed by thunderstorm.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oil loadings at the Russian port of Novorossiisk were suspended on Thursday because of a thunderstorm, shipping sources said.</p>
<p>The Black Sea port, the main outlet for Russian Urals crude exports, was closed at 0900 local time, after being shut for spells on Wednesday and overnight for the same weather reasons, the source said.</p>
<p>- London newsroom +44 171 542 8060</p>
